# Concept: the corridor after. A drag trail runs from a covered body into an
# open classroom door, a bloody hand slid down the door frame, a body sits
# slumped by a locker that is bleeding from its vents, and the bloody student
# ghost stands in the doorway, caught in the flashlight.
# GORE SET (optional): part of the gore option; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../concepts/concept_gore_aftermath.png
@preview ../previews/concept_gore_aftermath_x3.png 3
@fill D

@tiles t tiles_night_school.pix
@legend C t:ceiling
@legend P t:wall_plaster
@legend X t:wall_plaster_crack
@legend R t:wall_rail
@legend w t:wall_wainscot
@legend h t:wall_wainscot_hand
@legend F t:floor_top
@legend f t:floor_fill
@legend 1 t:window_0_0
@legend 2 t:window_1_0
@legend 3 t:window_0_1
@legend 4 t:window_1_1
@legend 5 t:door_0_0
@legend 6 t:door_1_0
@legend 7 t:door_0_1
@legend 8 t:door_1_1
@legend 9 t:door_0_2
@legend 0 t:door_1_2
@legend L t:lamp_off
@legend O t:lamp_on
@legend g t:geumjul
@legend s t:sign_plate
@legend T t:talisman
@legend d t:desk
@legend k t:locker_0_0
@legend l t:locker_0_1
@legend c t:candle_lit_0
@legend n t:note_glint

@legend a t:door_open_0_0
@legend b t:door_open_1_0
@legend e t:door_open_0_1
@legend i t:door_open_1_1
@legend j t:door_open_0_2
@legend m t:door_open_1_2
@layer
